Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Our nightmares aren't over,\NPrincess. Not yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.84,0:02:02.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(325.5,1053)}– The man's right!\N[REBEL SOLDIER C]\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish what happened was a nightmare, but it was real!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.94,0:02:06.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[REBEL SOLDIER D]\NWe want justice!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We saw King Cobra\Nattack Nanohana
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.81,0:02:08.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with our own eyes!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.58,0:02:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[REBEL SOLDIER E]\NThat's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.44,0:02:12.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And those damn Royals\Nshot Koza, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.11,0:02:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[REBEL SOLDIER F]\NYou expect us\Nall to just forgive them?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.25,0:02:16.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After what they did?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our nightmares will only be over
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.98,0:02:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,once we've killed every\NRoyal in this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.07,0:02:25.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHAKA]\NRoyal Army!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.30,0:02:27.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drop your weapons, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.84,0:02:32.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROYAL SOLDIER A]\NUp there!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.98,0:02:35.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.22,0:02:39.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROYAL SOLDIER B]\NIs he serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:41.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[IGARAM]\NYes. [clears throat]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:43.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.59,0:02:46.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[IGARAM]\NThat goes for\Nyou, too, Rebel Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:51.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROYAL SOLDIER C gasps]\NIgaram!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.60,0:02:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROYAL SOLDIER D]\NSquad Captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.76,0:03:01.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Igaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:07.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SOLDIERS chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.58,0:03:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He made it back.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.26,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[IGARAM]\NMay we meet again\Nsafely in our homeland,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.29,0:03:16.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.43,0:03:21.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey, it's that\Ncross-dressing guy
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from Whiskey Peak!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.28,0:03:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.14,0:03:26.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NUh, hey, who is that guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.45,0:03:29.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boy, can you talk to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.49,0:03:34.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the boy from Nanohana.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.46,0:03:37.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The kid who was harmed\Nby those Royal Army goons.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.20,0:03:39.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true!\NIt wasn't them!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.03,0:03:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The people who did this\Nlooked like members
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the Royal Army,\Nbut it really wasn't them!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please listen!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.30,0:03:45.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is what I saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISTER TWO]\NOoh!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.40,0:03:52.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It feels so good to get\Nback into gear! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:54.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ooh! [laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:56.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We pulled it off!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.86,0:04:01.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOZA]\NThat's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were all manipulated.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.40,0:04:05.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This battle was a plot from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SOLDIERS gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[REBEL SOLDIER I]\NKoza!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:10.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[REBEL SOLDIER J]\NLeader!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.24,0:04:13.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[IGARAM]\NRoyal or rebel,\NI'll explain it to you all.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.92,0:04:17.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything that has befallen our fair country.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.49,0:04:20.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But only if you drop your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:22.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SOLDIERS chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROYAL SOLDIER F]\NPrincess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:39.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SOLDIERS chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.11,0:04:41.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NMy friends. Where are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.39,0:04:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NCome on, Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know you're hurt, but keep up!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.92,0:04:47.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]\NI wish I could,\Nbut I'm coming down with
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the "If I Walk Anymore,\NI'll Die" disease.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.86,0:04:50.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI'll drag you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:51.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWait! Gah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.80,0:04:53.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me go, or I could\Ncome down with
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.73,0:04:56.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"If I Get Dragged Anymore,\NI'll Die" disease!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.60,0:04:57.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Found him?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.44,0:05:03.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NWho are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.61,0:05:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, just travelers passing through.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The guy on your back's one of us as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.46,0:05:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll take him now.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.34,0:05:13.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on. If you're\Nwith this young man,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.51,0:05:15.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then you must be those\Npirates who brought Vivi
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,back to this country.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.78,0:05:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. How would\Nyou know all that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NDaddy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.44,0:05:21.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.16,0:05:26.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.76,0:05:30.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! This guy is Vivi's dad?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.49,0:05:32.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess that makes you the king.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.16,0:05:34.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NYes, and I'd be\Na dead king if it weren't for
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.52,0:05:37.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the efforts of your brave,\Nyoung friend here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.65,0:05:38.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even though he'd\Ncome into contact
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.89,0:05:40.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with Crocodile's poison hook,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.01,0:05:43.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he still managed to\Ncarry myself and another
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to safety.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.75,0:05:47.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What unbelievable\Nstrength he has!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Should we be worried about the poison?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, is he gonna\Nbe all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.59,0:05:54.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NIt's okay.\NIt should be neutralized by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:55.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.66,0:05:57.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His injuries need to be treated.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.66,0:05:59.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So do yours, as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.90,0:06:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll wait.\NYou need to be somewhere else.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.83,0:06:06.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go back to the Square, Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHeh heh. He's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.09,0:06:09.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that the war's\Nover, it's only fitting
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.86,0:06:11.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for the king and princess\Nto say a few words,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.79,0:06:12.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,don't ya think?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.73,0:06:14.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, tell them what really happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.73,0:06:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, and I can tell\Nthem all about you guys too!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.37,0:06:19.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NVivi, dear. Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're a band of notorious pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.68,0:06:27.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need are our faces and names known.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.55,0:06:29.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what we do need is food!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.88,0:06:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And rest. We'd like to\Ncrash at the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:33.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that's okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.54,0:06:54.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NYes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.64,0:06:56.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Understood, Captain Smoker.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.78,0:06:59.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROYAL SOLDIER A]\NAre you serious?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.95,0:07:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was the one behind all this?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.95,0:07:06.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[REBEL SOLDIER B]\NAll this time,\Nwe thought he was a hero.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.49,0:07:09.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over there!\NLook! It's the Marines!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NI've just been\Ninformed that a Baroque Works
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ship has been seized...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.30,0:07:22.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,one that makes artificial\Nrain using Dance Powder.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.55,0:07:23.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You being Baroque Works'\Npresident,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.15,0:07:26.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been ordered to tell you this.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.15,0:07:29.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir Crocodile, one of the\NSeven Warlords of the Sea...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.59,0:07:36.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me. Tell me which\Nway Crocodile went.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.66,0:07:41.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NBy the authority\Nof the World Government,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.20,0:07:43.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hereby strip you of your authorization
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to capture enemy ships,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.57,0:07:46.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as well as all\Nthe titles and rights
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.14,0:07:47.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bestowed upon you\Nby the Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Additionally, you and\Nall Baroque Works agents
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.48,0:07:51.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:53.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINES chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DUCKS, KAROO squawk]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISTER TWO]\NThat's my cue to leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.28,0:08:23.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We rebels.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.65,0:08:27.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've done horrible things that can never be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:27.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NLeader.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.52,0:08:29.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say to him.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To any of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.97,0:08:36.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NWe all feel regret\Nover what has happened,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.14,0:08:38.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but that's natural.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.41,0:08:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NKing Cobra.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.77,0:08:43.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN B]\NYour Majesty.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.27,0:08:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NWe've lost so much,\Nand gained nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been divided.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.81,0:08:53.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NBut now we have a\Nchance to take a step forward!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter who you fought against,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.19,0:08:57.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the battle did occur and it's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We must put this strife\Nbehind us and become one again.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.53,0:09:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The king's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.53,0:09:07.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NUnfortunately,\Nthere's nothing we can do
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.43,0:09:10.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about what's happened.\NWe cannot change the past.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.22,0:09:16.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's one thing\Nwe can change, however,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.21,0:09:17.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that's our future!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:20.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.55,0:09:29.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's so wise.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.39,0:09:36.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NA future where all of\NAlabasta is united once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:38.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SOLDIERS chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.93,0:09:41.10,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThe monumental\Nbattle that will be engraved
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.13,0:09:43.17,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,upon the annals of history.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.55,0:09:59.72,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,the battle that\Nwill never be told...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:06.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...is finally over.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HINA]\NSmoker!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.40,0:10:12.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is this rain coming from?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.74,0:10:16.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you used the\NDance Powder on this ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.54,0:10:18.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.71,0:10:22.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I know better\Nthan to commit a crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen each other in quite some time,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.92,0:10:25.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the first thing\Nyou do is blame me
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.68,0:10:27.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for some natural rain?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.35,0:10:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I was about to tell you you look good.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.05,0:10:30.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HINA]\NYou're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.88,0:10:34.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was a lousy welcome.\NHina's sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As for the compliment,\NI can't believe
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.06,0:10:38.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the "White Hunter" would\Nsay something so sweet.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My, you've actually softened up a little.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.73,0:10:43.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut your trap, Hina.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.86,0:10:45.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HINA]\NIs that what I get\Nfor helping you out?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.80,0:10:48.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I might add, for the umpteenth time, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.40,0:10:50.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My elite unit found this ship for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.40,0:10:52.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A thanks would be nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.77,0:10:54.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Upset. Hina's upset.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.00,0:10:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't give me that speech.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're all Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.28,0:11:00.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how poor Tashigi\Nputs up with you, Smoker.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.62,0:11:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She manages somehow.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.62,0:11:09.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need you to take\Nthis ship in to HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:10.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HINA]\NMe?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.59,0:11:13.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NAlso, Tashigi's going\Nto be bringing Crocodile here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.36,0:11:16.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kill two birds with one stone\Nand take him with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.16,0:11:17.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HINA]\NGive me a break!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.16,0:11:19.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm an officer, not your\Npersonal errand girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's heads.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.83,0:11:28.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NIt's tails.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.23,0:11:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You lose, errand girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.17,0:11:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a real piece of work, you know that, Smoker?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.53,0:11:35.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought a few years of command would change you,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.30,0:11:36.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.93,0:11:38.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hina's disappointed.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.60,0:11:40.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.54,0:11:42.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I don't care.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.98,0:11:48.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Negative.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.16,0:11:49.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.49,0:11:50.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.65,0:11:52.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.65,0:11:54.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With your permission,\Nwe can capture
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.26,0:11:56.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all the Straw Hats\Nin one fell swoop!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.36,0:11:57.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Denied!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.43,0:11:59.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will not allow you to lay a hand on any of them!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.44,0:12:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B]\NBut we're never\Ngonna get another chance
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,like this again!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.14,0:12:05.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're sitting ducks right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.05,0:12:09.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NJust hang on, leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll get you taken care of.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And your father too. Leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.29,0:12:17.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There was a sandstorm in Yuba.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.56,0:12:21.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOZA]\NStill a worrywart\Nas always, I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how Yuba fared,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.04,0:12:24.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but take my word for it,\Na sandstorm
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.80,0:12:27.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is no match for my\Nstubborn old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.67,0:12:29.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.82,0:12:31.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOZA]\NDon't worry about me, either.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.82,0:12:34.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got his blood in my veins.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.09,0:12:37.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As soon as I get treated, I'll head to Yuba.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.76,0:12:40.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you updated.\NSo don't worry, all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.87,0:12:41.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NAll right.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.11,0:12:45.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON A]\NIt's actually raining!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.11,0:12:47.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON B]\NThis is the first time\Nin three years!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.21,0:12:48.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.25,0:12:50.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON C]\NThis rain will end the rebellion!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.28,0:12:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON D]\NOur foolish sons will come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KIDS laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.79,0:12:56.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPEOPLE chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:07.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DUGONGS cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.31,0:13:13.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOZA]\NHow long are you gonna\Nbe stubborn, old man?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.48,0:13:17.32,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Father, look around!\NYuba is finished! A ghost town!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.34,0:13:19.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna\Ndo here by yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.88,0:13:22.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna\Ndry up and die, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.01,0:13:23.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,516,1,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)\t(1392,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Old man!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.42,0:13:29.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, son. Look there.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.67,0:13:31.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rain has come back.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.94,0:13:36.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just like I told you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.30,0:13:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew that it would come back.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.63,0:13:40.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.87,0:13:46.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right as rain.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.57,0:13:52.08,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThe rain that\Nfalls in the kingdom
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is more than just\Na physical one,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.38,0:13:57.25,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,but also a symbolic\None that washes away
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.28,0:14:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the bitter tears\Nof its recent past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROUP snoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:17.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[IGARAM]\NPrincess Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.51,0:14:18.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing up?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.74,0:14:20.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NOh, hey, Igaram.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.91,0:14:22.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(511,1053)}– It's nothing.\N[door closes]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't sleep, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.58,0:14:28.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NIt's not that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.82,0:14:31.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just don't want to sleep right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.84,0:14:34.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd rather watch the rain fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.13,0:14:36.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:39.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROUP snoring]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.48,0:14:55.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[IGARAM]\NVivi, about Pell.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.83,0:14:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was, without a doubt,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.76,0:15:00.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the strongest, most loyal\Nand dignified warrior
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.10,0:15:02.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I ever served with.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.37,0:15:03.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.90,0:15:06.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just wish I could have said thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.74,0:15:12.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'd be greatly honored by that, Princess.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE E]\NCaptain Smoker! Miss Hina!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.64,0:15:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major\NTashigi has arrived!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.85,0:15:30.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– Welcome back, Sergeant Major!\N– Welcome back, Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sure has been a while, Tashigi.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.69,0:15:34.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NHina.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.59,0:15:38.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.38,0:15:40.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me,\NI'm a little tired,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.82,0:15:42.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to get some rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.00,0:15:47.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NWe're back, Captain Smoker.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.75,0:15:48.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you get my report?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.02,0:15:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure did. Thanks for your work.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.04,0:15:55.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard about what happened with the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.16,0:15:58.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.\NI helped the pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.49,0:16:00.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We also had an opportunity to capture them,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.18,0:16:01.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I let it slip away.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.25,0:16:04.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.80,0:16:07.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My actions were shameful.\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.77,0:16:09.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.57,0:16:10.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.66,0:16:14.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't you follow your justice like I told you to?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.53,0:16:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NNo. That's not it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.67,0:16:18.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B]\NSergeant Major.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NIt's just that I\Ndidn't have any other choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.11,0:16:31.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCODILE]\NJustice is only\Nfor the people who take it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.96,0:16:34.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of world we live in, girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.16,0:16:40.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me which\Nway Crocodile went.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.55,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1234,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Which way did he go?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.00,0:16:45.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NI was charged with\Nbringing Crocodile in,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.64,0:16:47.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't strong enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When Straw Hat Luffy asked where he was,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.51,0:16:51.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all I could do was tell him.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.81,0:16:54.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was also no match for Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was too weak.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.95,0:17:00.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So there was no\Njustice I could follow.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.80,0:17:06.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NI get it. You thought\Nyou were strong enough
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.87,0:17:09.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to defeat Crocodile,\Nbut you weren't,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.51,0:17:12.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so the Straw Hats stepped\Nup and did it instead.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats know\Nwhat you have to do
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.15,0:17:18.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to survive in this sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.15,0:17:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You either step up, or you die.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.22,0:17:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You did what you could, but it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.12,0:17:27.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luckily, you're still alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.13,0:17:29.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Learn from this experience.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.86,0:17:33.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI]\NWith your permission, sir,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.89,0:17:35.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get some rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.72,0:17:36.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.83,0:17:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NTashigi.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.50,0:17:53.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NDon't cry about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.91,0:17:55.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do what the Straw Hats did!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.81,0:17:57.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Step up, and become stronger!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.71,0:18:09.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NI just wish the rest\Nof you had the same kind
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.33,0:18:19.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of guts that she does.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.26,0:18:22.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, get those prisoners\Nloaded on the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.30,0:18:23.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– Yes, sir!\N– Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.50,0:18:26.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE F]\NCaptain! HQ for\Nyou on the transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.97,0:18:28.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.17,0:18:29.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[TRANSPONDER SNAIL]\NThis is Marine Headquarters calling.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.11,0:18:31.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could I speak with\NCaptain Smoker, please?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.78,0:18:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NSmoker here.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.08,0:18:35.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Congratulations on subduing Sir Crocodile, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.65,0:18:38.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a result, the top officials\Nof the World Government
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.09,0:18:40.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}have ordered that both you\Nand Sergeant Major Tashigi
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.36,0:18:42.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}be given medals for your efforts.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.09,0:18:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Subduing?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.29,0:18:45.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait, hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.26,0:18:47.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We aren't the ones\Nwho took down Crocodile...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it was the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.76,0:18:51.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did anyone even bother to read the report?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.55,0:18:53.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Furthermore, as thanks for your gallantry,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.53,0:18:55.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it's also been decided that each of you
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.13,0:18:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}will be promoted by one rank.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.80,0:18:58.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! I told you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.57,0:19:00.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For the umpteenth time,\Nit wasn't us!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.47,0:19:02.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me and Tashigi weren't the\Nones who stopped Crocodile
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.74,0:19:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and Baroque Works!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.61,0:19:06.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was those damn\NStraw Hat Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HINA]\NStop, Smoker. It's no use.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.13,0:19:09.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's obvious at this point\Nthat the Government's
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.70,0:19:11.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,going to cover up\Nthis entire incident.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think of the scandal if word\Nof what really happened
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.95,0:19:15.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,got out.\NAlabasta was almost toppled,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.99,0:19:17.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and it wasn't saved\Nby the Government,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.42,0:19:20.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but by a group of wanted pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.10,0:19:22.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[TRANSPONDER SNAIL]\NAnd of course, we\Nexpect both of you
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to attend the award ceremony,\Nwhere your medals...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.97,0:19:25.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NLike hell we will!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.59,0:19:28.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Smoker, don't be dumb!\NAccept it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you disobey the brass,\Nyou could get court-marshaled!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.00,0:19:33.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NWell, better\Nthat than live a lie.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.09,0:19:35.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We didn't take Crocodile down.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.09,0:19:37.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My subordinate's in tears\Nbecause we couldn't.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.60,0:19:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.10,0:19:41.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could you pass on a\Npersonal message from me
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.10,0:19:43.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the old geezers at HQ?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.34,0:19:45.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Smoker!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.24,0:19:47.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell 'em I said go to hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.61,0:19:56.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My, your medicine-making\Nskills are so innovative
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.95,0:19:58.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and practical.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.62,0:20:01.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.\NYou're a genius, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:02.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NUh...!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.85,0:20:05.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where in the world did you learn such techniques?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.62,0:20:08.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tony was a practicing doctor back in Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.22,0:20:09.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.22,0:20:10.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean the same Drum\Nthat was once renowned
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for its advanced medicine?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.66,0:20:15.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No wonder this little fellow is so talented.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.20,0:20:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow. I've been a doctor\Nfor forty years,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.60,0:20:19.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but even I don't know\Nthe techniques and remedies
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.87,0:20:21.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that you do.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're far younger\Nthan I but it's obvious
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.59,0:20:24.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm no match for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.96,0:20:27.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're clearly the superior doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.02,0:20:28.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bravo, my boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.09,0:20:30.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up, jerk! Stop saying that!\NI can't stand it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.03,0:20:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta here if you're\Ngonna talk like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.40,0:20:36.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's offering me tea and a\Nchair despite what he's saying.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.37,0:20:37.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does he want me to stay?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.70,0:20:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He certainly does!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.64,0:20:41.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DR. HOU]\NWell, in that case,\Nshow me more of your
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.54,0:20:42.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,incredible talents!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.75,0:20:44.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI said shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.62,0:20:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If only I could have\Nsplendid skills such as yours!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.09,0:20:50.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you\Nhow impressed I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.29,0:20:51.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NGet outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.33,0:20:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[hammering]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.99,0:21:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Does anybody have\Nany more lumber?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.64,0:21:03.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON B]\NNo, I'm out, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.84,0:21:05.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have some left;\Ntake whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON A]\NThanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.44,0:21:08.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, everyone's coming together.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.84,0:21:10.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's 'cause their\Nprincess is cute.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.94,0:21:11.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(288,1053)}– It is!\N[TOWNSPERSON D]\N– Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.51,0:21:15.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,House after house is like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.51,0:21:16.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could this have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:19.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There! A shortcut!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.13,0:21:19.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHow awful.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.97,0:21:21.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, Usopp.\NWhat's that over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.41,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI'll improve my concentration.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.05,0:21:33.96,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Until I can bring out\Nthat power anytime,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.02,0:21:37.09,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't consider myself stronger.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWow, they're all\Nsuch interesting books!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.59,0:21:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to take some with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.46,0:21:43.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, take any you'd like.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.40,0:21:44.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've read all of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.57,0:21:45.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'll definitely take\Nyou up on that offer!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.61,0:21:51.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've told you a hundred times there are no pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.97,0:21:54.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lying to us will only\Nharm your country!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.08,0:21:55.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Harboring pirates\Nis a major felony!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.98,0:21:57.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(352.5,1053)}[SANJI]\N– Hey, what's up?\N[USOPP]\N– Yo!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHAKA]\NOh, welcome back.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.65,0:21:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[SANJI]\NI was surprised we...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.48,0:22:01.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no evidence,\Nand I don't see
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:02.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,any pirates here, do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.79,0:22:04.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.92,0:22:06.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Luffy's woken up yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.92,0:22:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I doubt it. Things would\Nbe noisier if he had.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.76,0:22:12.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, man! I slept good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.03,0:22:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! My hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.58,0:22:17.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where the heck is my hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.84,0:22:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm starving, too!\NWhere's my breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:22.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My hat! My breakfast!\NMy hat! My breakfast!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.94,0:22:24.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My hat! My breakfast!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.08,0:22:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just woke up and you're\Nalready making a racket!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.17,0:22:28.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it won't be breakfast,\Nit'll be dinner. It's evening.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.94,0:22:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your hat's right over there, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.69,0:22:32.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you,\Na soldier found it
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.13,0:22:33.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,near the front of the palace.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.98,0:22:35.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I missed ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.44,0:22:37.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved you\Nfinally got well, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.53,0:22:40.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Got well?" Whaddya mean?\NI was never not well.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.16,0:22:41.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou dummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.23,0:22:43.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were in really bad shape and had a high fever.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi and Chopper have\Nbeen taking care of you
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.18,0:22:46.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.50,0:22:49.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? Thanks, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.04,0:22:50.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NAh, Luffy! You woke up!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.84,0:22:53.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NZoro! Long time no see!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.16,0:22:54.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.36,0:22:56.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHow dare you! You were\Nout training, weren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.93,0:22:58.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what?\NI didn't need your permission.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.60,0:22:59.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NOf course you did!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.70,0:23:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm your doctor!\NWhere are your bandages?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.87,0:23:03.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NIt was too hard\Nto move with 'em on.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.47,0:23:04.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYou shouldn't be moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.98,0:23:07.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Long time no see."
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.11,0:23:08.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why'd I say that?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.55,0:23:09.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Probably because it has been long.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.98,0:23:11.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've been asleep for three entire days.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.83,0:23:13.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThree days? Three whole days?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.06,0:23:15.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.63,0:23:19.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI missed fifteen meals.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.18,0:23:21.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure calculate quickly\Nwhen it comes to food!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.21,0:23:23.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By his count, that's like\Nfive meals a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.32,0:23:26.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard the captain's awake.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.12,0:23:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinner will be served shortly.\NI hope you're all hungry.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.56,0:23:32.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Old tube hair\Nguy! You're still alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.04,0:23:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that cross-dressing\Nthing wasn't just an act!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.23,0:23:36.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NNo, everyone, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.10,0:23:37.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is Terracotta.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.34,0:23:40.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's Igaram's wife and the head of the palace's servers.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.17,0:23:42.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping Vivi and my husband.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.28,0:23:44.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI've heard of wives\Nresembling their husbands,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.08,0:23:45.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but this is too weird!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.61,0:23:47.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard the captain eats a lot,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.25,0:23:49.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I had my staff put\Ntogether a little snack
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.28,0:23:50.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to tide you and\Nyour friends over.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.99,0:23:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.08,0:23:53.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Greedy pig!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.42,0:23:55.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm gonna eat three\Nwhole days' worth of food, lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.28,0:23:57.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, a challenge!\NGood! I'm looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.95,0:23:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never lost to\Nanyone's stomach,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.95,0:24:01.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so eat to your heart's content!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.79,0:24:09.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jeez. I've seen\Nhungry pigs eat less.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.56,0:24:11.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And with more manners, too, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.16,0:24:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the Royal Dining\NHall, not a trough!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.58,0:24:17.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Captain,\Nkeep it up. I can handle it.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.82,0:24:19.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This smells good!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.62,0:24:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you just snatched\Nmy food, didn't ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.36,0:24:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.43,0:24:28.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you keep eating\Nlike that, you're gonna choke.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.26,0:24:29.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's plenty more.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.87,0:24:31.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(108,0)}Snatch my food, will ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.17,0:24:32.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(108,0)}Some hot sauce will fix you.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.09,0:24:36.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NServes you right, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.84,0:24:38.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eyelash! When did you get here?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.24,0:24:39.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[EYELASH laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.70,0:24:41.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you call that dish there?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.08,0:24:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's called konafa...\Nnoodles baked in a brick oven.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.58,0:24:45.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.92,0:24:48.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TERRACOTTA]\NHere's more! Eat up!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.65,0:24:50.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old man, I never\Nknew you were the king!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.33,0:24:52.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess that means you're also Vivi's dad, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.60,0:24:53.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.38,0:24:56.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, maybe we should talk after dinner.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.95,0:24:58.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah, okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.82,0:25:00.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(101,226)}I need another round\Ndown here, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.95,0:25:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(101,0)}And water down here!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.25,0:25:05.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're loud, uncouth, and disgusting.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.82,0:25:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll say! I can't watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.32,0:25:09.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chattering, munching]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.09,0:25:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.63,0:25:12.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The princess...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.50,0:25:14.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can she keep\Nlaughing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:16.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NBean sprouts!\NI want sauteed bean sprouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.33,0:25:19.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROUP chattering, munching]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.98,0:25:24.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.41,0:25:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NThis is the palace's royal bath.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.74,0:25:47.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Normally we only use it\Nduring the rainy season.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.08,0:25:48.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI'm royally impressed!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.41,0:25:49.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.38,0:25:50.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm goin' in first!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.78,0:25:52.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNo way! I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.35,0:25:53.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NReal mature, guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.85,0:25:56.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well. That was some dinner\Ntonight, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.42,0:25:58.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought an after-dinner\Nbath would be a more
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.37,0:25:59.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,sedate affair.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.47,0:26:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it seems anything\Nyou lads get involved with
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.87,0:26:03.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,becomes a party very quickly.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.88,0:26:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, Zoro, look over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.34,0:26:06.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at what we're doing!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.71,0:26:07.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWe're training!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.84,0:26:08.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NReal funny.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.71,0:26:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um... Hey.\NWhere's the women's bath?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.91,0:26:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're nuts!\NAnd why would I tell you that?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.08,0:26:14.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's where the princess is!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.75,0:26:16.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.79,0:26:18.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NIt's right behind that wall!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.03,0:26:19.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.60,0:26:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHey, thanks, old guy!\NYou're the best!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.64,0:26:24.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThis feels so good!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.09,0:26:26.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if a ship with a big bath like this exists.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.72,0:26:27.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NI'm sure one does.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.75,0:26:29.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sea's full of surprises.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.99,0:26:31.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think of what we've seen.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.62,0:26:33.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Giants and dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.39,0:26:35.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Blossoms blooming in a winter land.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.96,0:26:38.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If those things exist,\Nthere must be plenty of
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.36,0:26:40.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,more amazing things\Nout there in the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.62,0:26:44.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NI... I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.44,0:26:45.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.61,0:26:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI chuckles]\NThank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.85,0:26:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you all doing over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.52,0:26:52.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peeping.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.65,0:26:55.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.49,0:26:58.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll cost 100,000\NBerries each.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.16,0:26:59.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.16,0:27:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[NAMI]\NHappiness... Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.76,0:27:01.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROUP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.66,0:27:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.64,0:27:04.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNami swan...!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.54,0:27:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't make up your mind?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.18,0:27:11.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.18,0:27:12.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Better think quick.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.32,0:27:14.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was thinking we might actually leave here tonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.88,0:27:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.81,0:27:18.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we need to go\Nwhile the goings good.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.28,0:27:20.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know that the Marines\Nare looking all over for us,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.75,0:27:23.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that means the ship\Nis in danger.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.99,0:27:27.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.19,0:27:28.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[GROUP]\N– Pervert.\N– Pervert.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.29,0:27:29.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COBRA]\NNot for that!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.22,0:27:33.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For the country.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.23,0:27:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not that we don't appreciate it,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.30,0:27:45.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but is a king supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.28,0:27:47.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The swordsman is right,\NYour Majesty.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.65,0:27:49.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're this land's\Nsovereign ruler...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.11,0:27:50.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you should bow to no one.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.91,0:27:52.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, Igaram.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.74,0:27:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Authority is something that you wear over your clothes.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.80,0:27:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we're in the bath now,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.99,0:28:00.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and there is no such\Nthing as a naked king,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.25,0:28:01.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is there?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.42,0:28:03.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of you\Nfrom the bottom of my heart,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.88,0:28:06.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as both a father and\Na native of this land,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.41,0:28:09.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alabasta will forever be\Nin your debt, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.73,0:28:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.34,0:28:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you all very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.03,0:28:18.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell you how\Nmuch we appreciate you!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.93,0:28:25.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NTonight?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.93,0:28:26.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYep.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.93,0:28:28.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWe have to leave?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.85,0:28:31.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Marines know we're here.\NMore'll be coming.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:31.12,0:28:32.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I agree with Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.28,0:28:33.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to get out now
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.82,0:28:34.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:34.79,0:28:36.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And not just 'cause\Nshe's got a pretty face.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.85,0:28:38.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NDo you think\Nwe should leave, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.08,0:28:40.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah, but only\Nafter we've had some more
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.62,0:28:41.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,yummy food!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.42,0:28:42.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NNo, now, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.72,0:28:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[GROUP]\N– Jeez, Luffy!\N– Jeez, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.84,0:28:45.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHAKA]\NWhat should we do, Igaram?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.17,0:28:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to let them\Nknow right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.33,0:28:49.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right. I agree. Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.82,0:28:52.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Word of what's happened\Nhere has traveled fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.22,0:28:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They've already released new wanted posters,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.20,0:28:57.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the bounties are quite large.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.39,0:29:01.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro.\NSixty million Berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.68,0:29:06.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy.\NOne hundred million Berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.21,0:29:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHAKA]\NIncredible.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.34,0:29:09.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[IGARAM]\NWith bounties like\Nthat, Marine Headquarters
Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.65,0:29:12.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,must have a keen interest\Nin capturing the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.85,0:29:15.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're no longer a mere pirate, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.72,0:29:18.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not since you took down\None of the Seven Warlords
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.46,0:29:19.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.59,0:11:01.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how poor Tashigi\Nputs up with you, Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:03.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SMOKER]\NI get it. You thought\Nyou were strong enough
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=4}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
